    {
      "id": "p0208-b004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Burgerpants speaks in a similar way in Japanese too - he uses proper and polite speech when speaking as an employee, but switches to different casual speaking styles in other situations. Burgerpants never uses personal pronouns when speaking formally in Japanese, but he does use the informal, masculine pronoun ore during more casual moments.",
        "raw": "Burgerpants speaks in a similar way in Japanese too - he uses proper and\npolite speech when speaking as an employee, but switches to different casual\nspeaking styles in other situations. Burgerpants never uses personal pronouns\nwhen speaking formally in Japanese, but he does use the informal, masculine\npronoun ore during more casual moments.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29668786,
          0.33489286,
          0.89654744,
          0.42048571
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
