    {
      "id": "p0208-b009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Toby noted that this can be taken either as a reference to the classic American game show The Price Is Right, or just as a simple English idiom. Because the game show reference would be lost in a literal translation, the translator chose to follow the idiom option. Thus, the new Japanese line became:",
